      "note": [
        "Region Gotland are responsible for municipal tasks and region tasks. This means that it is very difficult to compare data for the income statement and balance sheet for Region Gotland with other municipalities and regions in Sweden. Statistics Sweden has, in an attempt to comparability, estimated that 65 percent of their total activity concerns municipal activities, while 35 percent concerns region activities. Statistic Sweden will however point out that this is an estimation and that comparisons with other municipalities and regions should be made with caution. ",
        "Data concerning the most recent financial year are preliminary until the publication that takes place in August/September. After that, data for the most recent financial year, as well as data for older years, should be considered as final.  \r\n  \r\nFor more information about this year´s planned publications, see the publication calendar.",
        "Starting with the 2025 financial year, the publication of data in relation to the number of inhabitants will be discontinued. Users who wish to make their own calculations can obtain population data from [Population statistics](https://www.scb.se/be0101-en)."
      ],
